WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.200
Ryu uses Drive Reversal after Juri’s opening jab.

2
00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:03.200
Juri’s Drive Impact absorbs the recorded Drive Reversal.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.200
Juri’s Drive Impact Punish Counters Ryu into a crumple.

4
00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:04.700
Forward heavy begins the crumple conversion.

5
00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:06.200
Fuha-enhanced Ankensatsu continues the route.

6
00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:08.050
Forward medium leads into medium Fuhajin to regain a stock.
